# Public raw floor-presence39 preparation

Read `DESIGN.md` first. This is a source-only proposal for root/peer review before
any generator, host controls, reference decoder, SDK or QEMU campaign is run.
The preparer only read/wrote source bytes, produced focused adaptation diffs,
parsed Python AST and recorded SHA identities. It did not import any prepared
module, generate a corpus, run a test/decoder/compiler/emulator, touch a device,
change tracked files, use Git, or alter the existing mono21 evidence.

`generate.py` describes39 new valid raw floor1 cases,546packets,971520PCM16 bytes,
9mono/30stereo. Its output is create-only under a fresh direct `.build` child.
The writer and actual-byte reader are construction accounting, not independent
decode proof. `pcm_witness.py` derives the declared packet/channel silence spans
independently from overlap support and checks every silent PCM sample plus some
nonzero PCM on channels with a contributing floor. Nine constant-all-absent
cases and twelve mixed-mask stereo cases have separate silence witnesses.

`protocol.py`, `main.c`, `corpus_case.h` and `materialize.py` are focused adapters
of exact mono21 sources; each has its complete unified diff. The raw decoder,
CYD setup/output bridge, metadata/canaries/full packet consumption, PCM_HEX,
worker core1/priority3/stack16384 and coordinator core0 stay unchanged. The sole
large-count change is explicit uint64_t case masks/UINT64_C shifts/PRIu64 with
exact39case and546packet gates. Presence replaces the old blanket nonzero check
with strict per-frame predeclared silence/nonzero predicates. The independently
recovered C data gains39floor-mask arrays, for234arrays total.

No39 reference qualification or runnable target controller exists in this source
preparation. Root must review/adapt the dual-reference runner, complete recorded
qualification/binding, controller template and numeric adapter described in
`DESIGN.md`, with all source identities sealed before running them. Existing21
qualification cannot stand in for these new39 cases. Both explicit Xiph
libvorbis and independent FFmpeg-native vorbis decoders are mandatory. The
predeclared full-stream project error bound remains2LSB against each reference,
with exact geometry/format and identical silence witnesses. This finite work
does not establish fullG6, standard conformance or physical performance.

`source-inputs.json` records the exact read-only origins and reusable runtime /
reference sources. `readiness.json` covers every preparation file except itself.
No generated result, actual test pass or future execution outcome is claimed.

Immutable successor02 adds exact expected serial and BOS/EOS flags equality
assertions to the carrier readback. This closes a source-review finding before
any root generation or campaign. It changes no matrix, raw packet grammar,
reference/witness policy, C caller, protocol, materializer or production source.
Original01 remains untouched. Its original generator/readiness/source-review
bytes are retained under provenance/prep01, and predecessor.json pins the complete
original15-file preparation. Only source/hash/AST operations were executed.
